<title>NETHERLANDS: ING ups issue warrants on NBM-Amstelland.</title>
<headline>ING ups issue warrants on NBM-Amstelland.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Bank said on Thursday it had raised the number of call warrants on convertible preference shares in construction firm NBM-Amstelland NV by 500,000 to two million.</p>
<p>The bank said in February it would issue the warrants, which carry the right to buy one convertible preference share in NBM-Amstelland at a price of 47 guilders on February 17, 1999.</p>
<p>All call warrants are the sole responsibility of ING Bank and do not carry any voting or dividend rights in NBM-Amstelland, the bank said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
